LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974751_504344525677880_8757980474147716254_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oHjLeyzUPTMQ7kNvwGpEyJt&_nc_oc=AdozN5_-ApOdYfnv30eFui4C34J7x1DbUEEp5k6TjvU4gEI8YP62uktX-5VUiWNFsqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-YaXvlkCEjaU8i-D1UXaQ1T-oIhrDgG-J3lCrzxKIrA&oe=6AEA066B"}]}, "id": "1238928606731869", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "image1.png", "id": "1057387732496751", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540501_1057387735830084_2190979014283040881_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jkHPgTYRUf0Q7kNvwEIsjw0&_nc_oc=AdpzS_ae0EW16FseC7jdT8jvfKQEygqI6dcHy_9Xx40lPV3vsbqZyPqYRTzz9YUSLhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgzyawP00wW9R_B924G3GlnU0zEBNcPANxsJ9Zw9NEEg&oe=6AEA1533"}, {"file_name": "image2.png", "id": "410575135384874", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974821_410575138718207_8230945586108737660_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rk9MwyOIICgQ7kNvwHS31tj&_nc_oc=Adqvz1UWcvpRvGWUraxApk4_xj17sdCbT4UfPg7yTtFxJRqFGn5vEcjxLAvPkA4EgDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR4ea5u4KXWAr70uyx1K76sKtrW815eNs-djWJkqNaWTw&oe=6AEA0A18"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "27882995044633476", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_27882995047966809_2560160188894003364_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LZaPGtzuNa4Q7kNvwHd6mBc&_nc_oc=AdplSb71cqq4LU7qZMiGXD3n0zvcIJ4puSQ4ehVaQ7V2-Lfr4UF4-RA-AdO8r5t-3xQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAgg_pJsTyOuF5GcAAo-VSvzsehwsXwsspixgX5UxqOQ&oe=6AE9EC39"}, {"file_name": "image3.png", "id": "1012617210657646", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75280177_1012617213990979_1732549949916101256_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jPcLLdqaBGoQ7kNvwG3zRi0&_nc_oc=Adoa5raTZiR7C4gSW_1DWaj2sYxtmOyl1EhQu3D7Wt7UBuUqXhp5elM8k6nkU_fY7FA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSaLsqoEbSQo3lcVFUQsXfKfAiZFNWztucYJsTU2DYdmQ&oe=6AE9EDF8"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1151089155995496", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974848_1151089159328829_2039739925044486928_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s9K5XRGjUtQQ7kNvwGwZswW&_nc_oc=Adqsp-aMfuN0q2893_ea83bai2tmPQ2zPcIb6sniUJ4GSbUOzL-X53OvorVhVzEq6Dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBI4QCsJoaoetdWQek4dq7PjwFcHBu15bAfZQd9TS6ZQ&oe=6AE9E6EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Keyart_2560x1440.png", "id": "1984373528679847", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974591_1984373532013180_122028893976097645_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0zAdXH1SkocQ7kNvwFofGiO&_nc_oc=AdoR2e-5us-nyD6hheTgWNXnPb7F4s0yKoMPFJTQlqw88gd4SxqUSoUkQ7NJSMFzyng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSIXIxbRMIg6MtMYntCzdKBml3udqLY9jLOkkr3OY4ASA&oe=6AE9F9FB"}, "display_name": "My Monsters - Demo", "keywords": ["Third", "Action", "Adventure", "Indie", "Fanstasy"], "long_description": "My Monsters is an action-adventure VR game that with a *100% hand-painted art*, creating a visually stunning *world full of fantasy and surrealism*. At the heart of the game is a deep narrative that explores humanity's greatest inner struggles\u2014anxiety, fear, and loneliness. As a player, you are transported to Onirium, a *dream-like realm* where you meet Moti, a frightened little monster with no memory.\n\nIn My Monsters, you\u2019re never alone. *Team up with your inner monster*, Moti, to face a variety of enemies, solve intricate puzzles, and overcome challenges in a shared journey. This partnership mechanic fosters a powerful connection with Moti, requiring empathy and courage to navigate obstacles and reveal fragments of a *meaningful dreamlike tale*. Every stage introduces new aspects of this bond, allowing players to experience moments of self-discovery and emotional depth.\n\nKey Features on Demo:\n\n\n\u2694\ufe0f  Combat Enemies: Engage in dynamic battles with your enemies.\n\n\ud83e\udde9  Solve Puzzles: Test your critical thinking and problem-solving skills.\n\n\ud83c\udf19  A Dream-like Tale: Uncover a touching, emotional narrative that delves into themes of self-reflection and growth. \n\n\ud83c\udfa8  100% Hand-Painted Art: Every visual element in the game is carefully crafted by hand, creating a beautiful, one-of-a-kind experience. \n\n\ud83e\udd1d  Team Up with Your Inner Monster: Build a meaningful relationship with Moti, using teamwork, empathy, and courage to overcome every challenge.\n\n*THE GAME IS CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT, AND ITS CONTENT MAY CHANGE.*", "short_description": "My Monsters is a VR action-adventure game featuring stunning 100% hand-painted art. In this demo, you\u2019ll explore Onirium, a dream-like world filled with emotional depth, as you face humanity's greatest inner monsters like anxiety and fear. Meet Moti, a scared little monster with no memory, and team up to battle enemies, solve puzzles, and overcome challenges. Unravel fragments of a dreamlike narrative as you journey together. The game is currently in development, and its content may change."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ludact", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection":